aionnich/vidur-alibabacloud/README.md:293:| `request_preemption_time` | Time (in seconds) spent waiting due to scheduler preemption, pipeline bubbles, or other non-execution gaps. |
aionnich/vidur-alibabacloud/README.md:296:| `prefill_e2e_time` | Time To First Token (TTFT): `prefill_completed_at - arrived_at` (in seconds). |
