I found several concrete compatibility and correctness hazards beyond feature gaps: composite collective names are misparsed, checkpoint lists are parsed incorrectly, pipeline communication is accounted analytically rather than emitted as network traffic, and the inference KV formula uses MLP width where attention KV width is required. I’m incorporating these as evidence-backed findings, not treating README claims as implemented support.
